    "legend": {
      "fill": "green",
      "maxH": 560,
      "text": "Matches the Stride repo: mission.md, roadmap and the 5 epics (Catalog & Search, Accounts & Auth, Cart & Checkout, Account & Wishlist, Launch & Polish).\n\nFor: a beginner preparing for their first 5K/10K. Goal: landing \u2192 confirmed order in under 3 minutes.\n\n\u2022 8 pages, 11 routes (titles show each route).\n\u2022 ~30 products: Shoes / Apparel / Gear \u00d7 Road / Trail / Race day \u00d7 Men / Women / Unisex, prices in USD.\n\u2022 Sizes: shoes US 6\u201313 with halves, apparel XS\u2013XL, gear one size. Sold-out sizes disabled.\n\u2022 $5 shipping, free over $75. Mock payment only.\n\u2022 Login needed for checkout, account and wishlist. Guest cart merges on login.\n\u2022 Lime #D4FF3A only for actions.\n\nLeft out on purpose (v1 OUT): reviews, recommendations, coupons, taxes, colour variants, size guide, password reset, social login, emails.\n\nPress Play to click through the flow.",
